$'  \e[38;2;255;212;59m▸\e[0m Gold medal, 1st National AI Olympiad (ONIA), 2025: one of 28 among'
$'    716,000+.'
$'  \e[38;2;255;212;59m▸\e[0m ONIA ambassador, 2026 edition.'
$'  \e[38;2;255;212;59m▸\e[0m Gold medal, Brazilian Astronomy Olympiad (OBA), 2025: top 150 in'
$'    Brazil.'
$'  \e[38;2;255;212;59m▸\e[0m Invited speaker, II BRICS Forum, Brasília, Sep 2025.'
